          "text": {
            "type": "string",
            "value": "EXAMPLE 2: READING RESOURCES\n\nIn this example we've assigned 3 image resources into the Image Resource node.\nNext, we use a Read node, allowing us to cycle through the resources.\nThe main advantage here is that only 1 image file is loaded into memory each time."
          }
        },
